\[ F = k \frac{|q_1 q_2|}{r^2} \]

where \( k \) is Coulomb's constant (\( 8.99 \times 10^9 \, \text{N m}^2/\text{C}^2 \)), \( q_1 \) and \( q_2 \) are the charges, and \( r \) is the distance between the charges.

