- At 400 m: \( \text{FL} = 107.00 + (400/100) = 107.40 \), \( \text{RL} = 108.3 \), \( \text{height} = 107.40 - 108.3 = -0.9 \) m

### Step 2: Calculate Areas for Each Section
- Section 0-100 m:
  \[
  A_1 = 12 \times (2.2 + 0.9) / 2 = 12 \times 1.55 = 18.6 \, \text{m}^2
