First, we calculate the product \(\mathbf{A B}\):

\[
\mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix}
1 & 2 & -1 \\
0 & 3 & 1 \\
2 & 0 & 1
\end{pmatrix}, \quad \mathbf{B} = \begin{pmatrix}
2 & 1 & 0 \\
0 & -1 & 2 \\
1 & 1 & 3
\end{pmatrix}
