   - The surface area \( A_{\text{original}} \) of a rectangular block is given by:
     \[
     A_{\text{original}} = 2(lw + lh + wh)
     \]
     Substituting the given dimensions:
     \[
     A_{\text{original}} = 2(12 \times 8 + 12 \times 6 + 8 \times 6)
