   \[
   V = \frac{4}{3} \pi r^3
   \]
   where \(r\) is the radius of the sphere. For a marble with radius \(1 \text{ cm}\):
   \[
   V = \frac{4}{3} \pi (1)^3 = \frac{4}{3} \pi \text{ cm}^3
