   \]

6. **Ratio of the Rise in Liquid Levels:**
   The ratio of the rise in the liquid level in the narrow cone to the rise in the liquid level in the wide cone is:
   \[
   \frac{\Delta h_1}{\Delta h_2} = \frac{\frac{4}{9}}{\frac{1}{9}} = 4
